WEBVTT

00:03.270 --> 00:05.520
She's woken up.

00:05.830 --> 00:06.990
All of her injuries,

00:06.990 --> 00:10.360
as well as her body's missing 
parts, have been healed.

00:11.060 --> 00:13.850
You regenerated her body in just a day?!

00:13.850 --> 00:17.700
That's easily done with the power 
of my Alchemy Ward.

00:18.050 --> 00:18.910
There's just...

00:18.910 --> 00:20.870
one problem.

00:22.250 --> 00:25.710
It would seem she's lost her memories.

00:25.710 --> 00:27.040
Huh?

00:27.040 --> 00:29.500
She has amnesia.

00:29.500 --> 00:31.640
She still retains common knowledge,

00:31.640 --> 00:34.550
and the ability to read, write, 
and do calculations,

00:34.550 --> 00:37.140
but all her memories about herself are gone.

00:37.510 --> 00:41.060
Is that an after-effect of her treatment?

00:42.080 --> 00:44.130
Of course it isn't!

00:44.130 --> 00:46.330
It'd be one thing if I had 
to regenerate her head,

00:46.330 --> 00:50.320
but regenerating limbs isn't going to 
make anyone lose their memories!

00:50.320 --> 00:51.710
If you doubt me,

00:51.710 --> 00:57.250
why don't we try cutting off the extra part
in your crotch and regrowing that?

00:58.670 --> 01:01.070
I won't let you cut it off for a reason like that!

01:01.070 --> 01:03.150
Really? Well, then.

01:06.460 --> 01:09.670
Amnesia, huh?

01:09.670 --> 01:11.570
We're here.

01:26.830 --> 01:28.020
Hello.

01:29.330 --> 01:30.740
Are you feeling all right?

01:32.310 --> 01:33.500
What's your name?

01:34.050 --> 01:35.440
I don't know.

01:36.330 --> 01:38.330
How did you get those injuries?

01:38.330 --> 01:39.410
I don't know.

01:39.840 --> 01:42.620
<i>Hmm... What do I do here?</i>

01:42.620 --> 01:45.540
<i>I hope she remembers eventually...</i>

01:46.510 --> 01:47.460
And you are?

01:49.320 --> 01:51.000
Who are you?

01:51.000 --> 01:56.980
Oh, I'm Mochizuki Touya, 
Grand Duke of the Brunhild Duchy.

01:57.550 --> 01:58.470
A monarch?

01:59.340 --> 02:01.870
Is this Brunhild?

02:01.870 --> 02:02.810
Yeah.

02:03.320 --> 02:06.310
I found you collapsed in the mountains 
and brought you here.

02:06.310 --> 02:08.570
You were badly injured.

02:09.790 --> 02:12.520
Not having a name for you 
is inconvenient, though.

02:13.280 --> 02:15.660
Do you want to pick a temporary name?

02:15.660 --> 02:16.530
A name?

02:17.470 --> 02:18.840
Anything is fine.

02:19.850 --> 02:21.450
You decide.

02:21.850 --> 02:23.010
Me?

02:31.610 --> 02:32.590
Sakura.

02:32.590 --> 02:33.830
Huh?

02:33.830 --> 02:35.430
How about Sakura?

02:36.500 --> 02:37.550
Sakura?

02:38.230 --> 02:41.200
Because you have pretty hair 
the color of cherry blossoms.

02:41.200 --> 02:43.350
If you don't like it, we can pick another.

02:43.350 --> 02:44.750
Sakura is fine.

02:45.800 --> 02:47.020
Thank you.

02:49.840 --> 02:53.920
Gather up your tears

02:53.920 --> 02:56.320
And release your unhindered light

02:56.320 --> 03:01.250
That shines like a diamond

03:01.250 --> 03:02.760
Don't worry, don't care

03:02.760 --> 03:05.800
Follow your heart

03:16.590 --> 03:22.850
Every time I spoke of my
dreams, they felt closed off

03:22.850 --> 03:29.160
Even that bird and that sky
seemed monochrome to me

03:29.160 --> 03:35.610
Yet you were there in my path,
your eyes brimming with strength

03:35.610 --> 03:42.290
Time then stopped, and deep within
my heart something began to stir

03:44.360 --> 03:48.370
Don't be afraid, and run forth

03:48.370 --> 03:50.740
If we only have one life to live

03:50.740 --> 03:57.050
Then be true to yourself,
so you don't regret it

03:57.050 --> 04:01.140
Gather up your tears

04:01.140 --> 04:03.520
And release your unhindered light

04:03.520 --> 04:08.540
That shines like a diamond

04:08.540 --> 04:10.010
Don't worry, don't care

04:10.010 --> 04:13.160
Follow your heart

04:18.980 --> 04:23.990
Episode 10

04:18.980 --> 04:23.990
Amnesia and the Mystic Eye of Petrification

04:24.810 --> 04:28.580
So is Sakura still in the Alchemy Ward?

04:28.980 --> 04:33.660
No, she's able to walk on her own now, 
so I moved her to the guest rooms here.

04:34.110 --> 04:36.830
I think she's out for a stroll at the moment.

04:36.830 --> 04:39.300
Is it okay to leave her by herself?

04:39.630 --> 04:43.800
Kougyoku is with her as her 
bodyguard, so I think she'll be fine.

04:44.490 --> 04:48.660
She's awfully carefree for someone 
who's lost their memory.

04:48.660 --> 04:50.580
Doesn't it make her feel uneasy?

04:50.580 --> 04:54.190
She probably doesn't experience 
that kind of feeling at all.

04:54.610 --> 04:57.050
If she can't remember anything about herself,

04:57.050 --> 04:59.940
there's nothing for her to feel sad over.

05:00.660 --> 05:05.070
I suppose that might be true.

05:05.730 --> 05:09.760
Well, I'm heading to the 
knights' training ground.

05:09.760 --> 05:12.200
I'm off to practice cooking.

05:12.680 --> 05:13.630
What about you?

05:15.060 --> 05:17.540
There aren't any audiences 
planned for today....

05:20.780 --> 05:28.810
No matter how many times

05:28.810 --> 05:36.180
the colors of the seasons paint the wind,

05:36.180 --> 05:44.170
the warmth of those nostalgic days

05:44.170 --> 05:52.140
that warms me deep in my heart

05:52.640 --> 06:03.580
will stay with me no matter 
where I go in the future...

06:03.580 --> 06:04.840
Sakura?

06:05.410 --> 06:06.550
Your Royal Highness?

06:08.170 --> 06:09.660
That song just now...

06:10.220 --> 06:12.580
Your voice was so beautiful, it shocked me.

06:12.580 --> 06:13.970
Really?

06:13.970 --> 06:16.030
Do you like singing?

06:16.030 --> 06:17.700
I don't really know...

06:17.700 --> 06:20.110
But I do feel as if I liked it.

06:24.030 --> 06:25.030
I know!

06:34.100 --> 06:34.990
Good.

06:43.960 --> 06:46.710
Yeah. How many years has it been?

06:49.020 --> 06:51.140
<i>It's been so many years since I played one.</i>

06:51.140 --> 06:55.970
<i>When I was a kid, I couldn't play 
very well, so I practiced a lot.</i>

07:08.480 --> 07:09.740
Sakura?

07:10.290 --> 07:12.600
Is this what you wanted to show me?

07:12.600 --> 07:14.740
Yeah. It's called a piano.

07:15.310 --> 07:18.500
When you press these white and 
black keys, it plays a sound.

07:18.880 --> 07:23.120
I thought maybe you'd enjoy 
an instrument like this.

07:24.270 --> 07:25.870
I want to hear more.

07:25.870 --> 07:26.600
Huh?

07:26.600 --> 07:28.790
Play a different song.

07:28.790 --> 07:29.630
A different one?

07:30.260 --> 07:32.920
Hmm... Okay...

07:33.370 --> 07:34.590
Oh, I know.

07:40.270 --> 07:42.180
Is this how it went?

07:51.120 --> 07:58.870
The warmth of those nostalgic days

07:57.910 --> 07:59.950
<i>She really is amazing at it!</i>

07:58.870 --> 08:06.960
that warms me deep in my heart

08:07.410 --> 08:18.850
will stay with me no matter 
where I go in the future...

08:21.640 --> 08:22.860
Impressive!

08:22.860 --> 08:24.880
You have a very beautiful voice!

08:24.880 --> 08:27.020
I found myself most enchanted by it.

08:29.020 --> 08:32.050
Sakura, would you sing more for us?

08:32.050 --> 08:33.480
That's a great idea!

08:33.480 --> 08:35.780
Yeah! I want to hear more, too!

08:35.780 --> 08:36.800
Huh?

08:37.300 --> 08:38.930
What would you like to do?

08:44.710 --> 08:49.710
My heart races and aches 
deep within because I love you...

08:47.030 --> 08:48.680
<i>There's more?!</i>

08:53.830 --> 08:56.510
Are you familiar with a monster 
called the Catoblepas?

08:57.060 --> 08:59.690
No, I've never heard of that.

09:00.150 --> 09:01.810
What kind of monster is it?

09:02.180 --> 09:03.780
It's very strong.

09:04.190 --> 09:07.650
It can spew poison from its mouth
that's so strong, it makes flowers wilt.

09:07.650 --> 09:10.480
But what's most terrifying is its Mystic Eyes.

09:10.480 --> 09:11.820
Mystic Eyes?

09:12.340 --> 09:17.260
Those who meet eyes with the Catoblepas 
quickly find their legs won't move,

09:17.260 --> 09:20.280
and eventually, their 
entire body turns to stone.

09:20.280 --> 09:21.950
I see.

09:21.950 --> 09:23.120
Petrification, huh?

09:23.560 --> 09:26.460
So now that monster has taken up 
residence in the Melicia Mountains,

09:26.460 --> 09:28.880
and there have already been casualties?

09:28.880 --> 09:29.970
Yes.

09:29.970 --> 09:32.800
We've received word that three 
parties, totaling thirteen adventurers,

09:32.800 --> 09:35.100
have already been turned to stone.

09:35.100 --> 09:36.510
Thirteen?

09:36.910 --> 09:39.470
If nothing is done, 
the damage will only worsen.

09:39.810 --> 09:43.860
That's why we'd like to request 
the aid of Your Royal Highness,

09:43.860 --> 09:45.480
one of the highest-ranked adventurers.

09:46.970 --> 09:50.190
Have you talked about this to 
any adventurers other than me?

09:50.190 --> 09:50.980
No.

09:51.370 --> 09:55.660
Frankly, the only one matching 
your rank that we could rely on

09:55.660 --> 09:58.990
is the previous king of 
the Lestia Knight Kingdom.

09:58.990 --> 10:02.160
But we shouldn't be relying 
on a man in his seventies...

10:02.580 --> 10:03.990
Lestia?

10:03.990 --> 10:08.850
<i>So that princess's grandfather was 
an adventurer of the highest rank?</i>

10:09.990 --> 10:10.860
Your Royal Highness?

10:10.860 --> 10:12.960
Oh, sorry!

10:12.960 --> 10:15.340
I just know someone in Lestia.

10:15.790 --> 10:19.700
Okay, so there's no one other 
than me who can defeat it.

10:19.700 --> 10:20.790
Yes.

10:21.690 --> 10:25.270
I'm terribly sorry to bring this request 
directly to Your Royal Highness

10:25.270 --> 10:27.310
now that you rule a nation,

10:28.340 --> 10:30.270
but would you please handle this for us?

10:34.660 --> 10:37.780
By the way, what's the bounty 
for defeating it?

10:37.780 --> 10:39.020
Right.

10:39.020 --> 10:41.890
The reward that we've gathered from 
the surrounding towns and villages

10:42.370 --> 10:43.370
comes to this amount.

10:45.750 --> 10:47.220
All right.

10:47.220 --> 10:48.960
I'll accept this quest.

10:50.290 --> 10:51.590
You're sure?

10:51.590 --> 10:52.390
Yes.

10:52.390 --> 10:57.090
I'll probably be fine since I have 
my null magic spell, Recovery.

10:57.090 --> 11:00.600
I think I'll be able to save the adventurers 
that got turned to stone, as well.

11:01.000 --> 11:02.890
Thank you so much!

11:02.890 --> 11:04.810
We'll be counting on you!

11:05.350 --> 11:06.490
So there you have it.

11:06.490 --> 11:07.740
I see!

11:07.740 --> 11:10.190
So you accepted it because 
the reward was great.

11:10.190 --> 11:12.450
Don't make me sound so bad.

11:12.450 --> 11:15.370
I can't allow it to cause any 
more harm than it already has.

11:15.370 --> 11:17.420
I mean, the reward is important, too.

11:17.420 --> 11:20.030
It costs a lot of money to 
manufacture a Frame Gear.

11:20.480 --> 11:21.800
Catoblepas...

11:21.800 --> 11:23.910
That's a monster that rarely ever appears.

11:24.360 --> 11:27.580
There aren't many Catoblepas 
in the first place.

11:27.580 --> 11:29.990
It's hard for them to mate, for one thing.

11:29.990 --> 11:32.290
Huh? Why is that?

11:32.290 --> 11:34.890
Both possess Mystic Eyes of Petrification,

11:34.890 --> 11:38.590
so they both have to avoid petrifying 
the other while trying to do it.

11:39.040 --> 11:42.180
Wait, Catoblepas can petrify each other?

11:42.180 --> 11:42.840
Yes.

11:43.290 --> 11:47.040
So they can't even gaze into their lover's eyes.

11:47.040 --> 11:48.680
That's so sad.

11:52.520 --> 11:55.320
Anyway, I'm heading out now!

11:55.760 --> 11:58.350
I'll probably be back by this evening.

11:58.350 --> 12:01.060
Huh? We'll all go with you.

12:01.060 --> 12:02.990
Huh? Why?

12:02.990 --> 12:05.990
With you around, we won't 
have to fear being petrified.

12:05.990 --> 12:08.480
It's been a while since we hunted a monster!

12:08.480 --> 12:10.710
I want to see a Catoblepas!

12:10.710 --> 12:12.440
I'd love to test my strength!

12:12.440 --> 12:14.590
I want to be helpful, too.

12:14.590 --> 12:16.040
I'll pass.

12:17.570 --> 12:20.030
I don't think it'll be too dangerous, though...

12:20.030 --> 12:22.010
Well, I guess it's fine.

12:43.790 --> 12:45.690
It's beautiful.

12:45.690 --> 12:47.200
I named it Touka (transparent flower).

12:47.200 --> 12:48.280
Touka?

12:48.840 --> 12:53.540
This should make defeating 
the Catoblepas much easier.

12:53.540 --> 12:56.960
Though I actually made it 
for use against the Phrase.

12:57.340 --> 12:59.020
Touya-dono!

12:59.020 --> 13:00.840
Thank you so much!

13:01.620 --> 13:03.460
I'm glad you like it.

13:07.580 --> 13:10.720
Stop giving me that look.
I have one for each of you.

13:12.550 --> 13:13.550
Master.

13:13.550 --> 13:15.940
We've arrived over our destination.

13:30.030 --> 13:31.870
Yeah, this way.

13:31.870 --> 13:33.160
Touya...

13:33.160 --> 13:37.540
Are you sure you don't want to restore 
the petrified adventurers to normal first?

13:37.540 --> 13:41.470
Yeah, it wouldn't be good 
to drag them into our fight.

13:41.470 --> 13:44.050
I'll heal them after we defeat the Catoblepas.

13:50.290 --> 13:51.220
There it is.

13:55.170 --> 13:59.530
I added Recovery to all of your 
engagement rings ahead of time,

13:59.530 --> 14:02.000
so even if you start to petrify, just stay calm.

14:12.630 --> 14:13.700
First strike!

14:20.810 --> 14:22.130
Shimmer forth, Light!

14:22.130 --> 14:24.840
Dazzling Brilliance: Flash!

14:25.380 --> 14:26.870
Come forth, Sand!

14:26.870 --> 14:30.010
Obstructing Dust Storm: Blind Sand!

14:43.790 --> 14:45.650
It's poison smoke! Be careful!

14:48.500 --> 14:49.280
Linze!

14:49.280 --> 14:50.450
Fly!

14:52.320 --> 14:53.390
Are you okay?

14:53.390 --> 14:54.780
Y-Yes.

14:55.160 --> 14:58.410
But that was a little scary.

14:58.820 --> 15:02.100
<i>She's soft, and she smells nice...</i>

15:02.600 --> 15:05.080
<i>But this is no time to be 
thinking about that!</i>

15:08.710 --> 15:09.880
Storage!

15:22.040 --> 15:23.310
Gravity!

15:30.670 --> 15:31.920
We did it.

15:31.920 --> 15:34.020
Touya, your feet!

15:34.020 --> 15:35.030
Huh?

15:38.110 --> 15:39.580
R-Recovery!

15:44.000 --> 15:45.350
So heavy...

15:46.630 --> 15:48.250
Damn you!

15:49.060 --> 15:52.780
Crap! The petrification went 
all the way through my socks?!

15:53.280 --> 15:55.710
Are you all right, Touya?

15:55.710 --> 15:56.740
Yeah.

15:56.740 --> 16:00.910
Apparently Recovery won't work 
on anything other than the body.

16:01.540 --> 16:02.310
What's wrong?

16:03.650 --> 16:05.780
R-Recovery!

16:06.620 --> 16:07.360
Lu?

16:08.710 --> 16:10.830
Its eyes... I looked at its eyes!

16:10.830 --> 16:13.700
It started petrifying me, 
even though it's dead!

16:13.700 --> 16:16.420
Its Mystic Eyes are still petrifying!

16:15.390 --> 16:17.630
Lu, please calm down.

16:17.630 --> 16:21.710
The Catoblepas's Mystic Eyes continue to 
be effective for a while after they die.

16:21.710 --> 16:23.730
The petrification has stopped.

16:23.730 --> 16:24.920
You're fine.

16:25.640 --> 16:27.880
Your body should be back to normal.

16:32.540 --> 16:34.020
Do you have any spare shoes?

16:34.020 --> 16:36.720
Yes, in my ring's Storage.

16:42.230 --> 16:45.150
T-Touya! Please turn around!

16:45.530 --> 16:46.360
Huh?

16:47.090 --> 16:47.890
Touya!

16:47.890 --> 16:51.360
Please do as Lu requested! Hurry, hurry!

16:50.010 --> 16:51.360
O-Okay, okay!

16:51.900 --> 16:53.490
<i>What the heck is going on?</i>

16:53.490 --> 16:54.990
Lu, did it...

16:54.990 --> 16:57.460
Exactly, yes.

16:57.460 --> 16:59.650
No way! Even your underwear?!

16:59.650 --> 17:01.060
<i>Underwear?!</i>

17:01.060 --> 17:03.340
<i>Huh? Her underwear got petrified?</i>

17:03.340 --> 17:06.790
<i>Th-Then that piece of stone that fell...</i>

17:06.790 --> 17:10.050
I think the Catoblepas's 
petrification probably starts

17:10.050 --> 17:13.300
from either the ground 
or the part closest to it.

17:13.300 --> 17:15.930
So since Lu fell on her butt earlier...

17:15.930 --> 17:18.660
Oh, so that's why?

17:18.660 --> 17:20.550
What a terrible thing to happen.

17:20.550 --> 17:22.550
Do you have a spare pair of underwear?

17:22.550 --> 17:25.620
I have one set in my Storage, but...

17:25.620 --> 17:27.920
It would be better to 
change it all at this point.

17:27.920 --> 17:30.900
Your tights and skirt are ruined, too.

17:30.900 --> 17:31.860
Touya!

17:32.280 --> 17:33.320
Y-Yes?!

17:33.320 --> 17:35.310
Do not turn around, no matter what!

17:35.310 --> 17:37.080
You can't do it, okay, Touya?

17:37.080 --> 17:38.780
I-I got it!

17:41.970 --> 17:44.650
<i>M-Maybe I should cover my ears, too?</i>

17:48.000 --> 17:48.960
Oh, no!

17:52.700 --> 17:55.310
And I just changed them, too!

17:55.310 --> 17:56.470
Recovery!

18:00.060 --> 18:01.260
Everyone, watch out!

18:01.680 --> 18:02.910
There's another one!

18:02.910 --> 18:03.920
Huh?!

18:03.920 --> 18:05.790
H-Hold on a moment!

18:05.790 --> 18:07.350
I'm still getting my skirt on!

18:10.690 --> 18:14.500
<i>Damn it, those Mystic Eyes are 
preventing me from attacking.</i>

18:15.170 --> 18:18.280
<i>If I could just cover those eyes...</i>

18:20.530 --> 18:21.930
What is it?

18:21.930 --> 18:24.740
There <i>is</i> a way to block its sight!

18:24.740 --> 18:25.620
Huh?!

18:25.900 --> 18:28.890
I found it in a book I read 
while searching for Fly!

18:31.190 --> 18:32.360
Mosaic!

18:39.760 --> 18:40.660
Now!

18:40.660 --> 18:41.890
Right!

18:44.230 --> 18:47.100
Surely there won't be three of them.

18:48.350 --> 18:50.640
Thank you, Yae.

18:50.640 --> 18:52.750
That was a splendid use of your sword.

18:52.750 --> 18:56.440
No, no, it was only thanks to 
you keeping the beast in place.

18:56.920 --> 18:58.360
Our teamwork is perfect, huh?

18:58.360 --> 18:59.300
Yeah!

19:01.270 --> 19:04.700
I was the only one who couldn't do anything.

19:06.230 --> 19:08.790
I can't believe there were two of them.

19:09.330 --> 19:12.290
I apologize for our lack of investigation.

19:12.650 --> 19:13.860
It's fine.

19:13.860 --> 19:16.380
You gave me enough reward money 
for two of them, anyway.

19:16.380 --> 19:18.250
Thank you so much.

19:18.250 --> 19:22.130
Well, that just leaves fixing 
those who were petrified.

19:22.130 --> 19:23.680
True.

19:24.940 --> 19:26.100
Recovery!

19:24.940 --> 19:26.510
P-Please wait!

19:35.030 --> 19:36.540
Oh, crap!

19:36.540 --> 19:39.200
M-M-M-Mosaic!

19:41.560 --> 19:43.310
What is that?

19:53.540 --> 19:54.690
<i>Here I go!</i>

19:59.880 --> 20:03.290
<i>What kind of attack was that? Too soft!</i>

20:03.910 --> 20:06.520
<i>This is rather difficult.</i>

20:08.770 --> 20:11.520
Damn, I lost again.

20:11.520 --> 20:14.080
One more round! One more!

20:15.360 --> 20:18.330
Please let me have a turn next, 
Your Royal Highness!

20:18.890 --> 20:21.260
You all like it, then?

20:21.260 --> 20:27.070
Yeah! I'm impressed you 
made something this fun!

20:27.070 --> 20:30.030
I found myself absorbed 
in it, despite my age.

20:30.030 --> 20:34.430
Though I haven't gotten any better 
since our last social call.

20:34.430 --> 20:35.850
True.

20:35.850 --> 20:40.820
If we had a Frame Unit in our country, 
we could take our time practicing.

20:40.820 --> 20:42.620
Then why don't I lend them to you?

20:42.620 --> 20:43.220
Huh?!

20:43.220 --> 20:44.490
You mean it?!

20:44.490 --> 20:45.360
Oh!

20:45.360 --> 20:47.060
I would appreciate that.

20:47.060 --> 20:49.720
P-Please lend our country one, too!

20:49.720 --> 20:54.190
Sure. Please let your knights use them, too.

20:54.670 --> 20:57.720
With something to look forward to, 
they'll be able to work hard at training.

20:58.170 --> 21:03.430
<i>Brunhild might not be enough on its own 
to handle large masses of Phrase.</i>

21:03.430 --> 21:07.310
<i>I should at least prepare 
for that eventuality.</i>

21:23.280 --> 21:26.050
Your sighs are getting irritating.

21:26.780 --> 21:28.260
G-Grandfather!

21:28.260 --> 21:33.770
Honestly, you've been 
sighing all the time lately.

21:33.770 --> 21:36.690
I-I don't think that's true.

21:36.690 --> 21:38.950
Well, no matter.

21:39.790 --> 21:41.370
More importantly, Hilde.

21:41.370 --> 21:42.550
Yes?

21:42.550 --> 21:46.700
The Grand Duke of Brunhild 
said that transparent sword

21:46.700 --> 21:50.790
can't be made without unique processing?

21:50.790 --> 21:51.540
Huh?

21:51.540 --> 21:54.040
Oh, yes. He did.

21:54.040 --> 21:56.120
I see.

21:56.520 --> 22:00.380
So the rumors about the 
Grand Duke of Brunhild

22:00.380 --> 22:03.970
possessing many mysterious weapons are true.

22:05.340 --> 22:09.240
Giant soldiers that people ride in, huh?

22:09.240 --> 22:12.810
Well, then, what shall we do?

22:13.140 --> 22:14.700
Grandfather?

22:30.850 --> 22:33.870
Every day is bittersweet

22:33.870 --> 22:36.280
(Bubbly bubbly)

22:36.280 --> 22:41.750
I might still blush when 
your eyes are close up

22:42.940 --> 22:47.360
Our love affair goes around with 
the 1, 2, 3 beat of I, My, Me, Mine

22:47.360 --> 22:50.230
But "Look solely at me"

22:50.600 --> 22:56.360
Is something I can't say; 
I want you to notice my jealousy

22:57.640 --> 23:00.290
My hero glimpsed through a lens

23:00.290 --> 23:04.090
I want you to take everything, 
even your flawed kindness

23:04.090 --> 23:06.800
And fill me up with goodness even more

23:06.800 --> 23:09.470
(even more)

23:09.470 --> 23:12.310
Until I burst

23:12.310 --> 23:17.350
My heart races and aches deep 
within because I love you

23:17.350 --> 23:22.800
My love is rapidly rising, 
but, but, but, but

23:22.800 --> 23:26.590
I can't help that we're in another world

23:26.590 --> 23:31.680
Let's sing about this joyous occasion 
illuminated by the brilliant sun!

23:31.680 --> 23:33.710
"Together forever!"

23:33.710 --> 23:38.000
I may not be much, but I want you 
to hug me from time to time,

23:38.000 --> 23:39.600
And if you're far away, that's okey-dokey

23:39.600 --> 23:42.090
We'll live happily ever after!
